  "historyNote": "#2269, eff 1-10-83; ss by #2963, eff 1-22-85; ss by #4314, eff 9-27-87; ss by #4659, eff 8-4-89; EXPIRED: 8-4-95 New. #6285, eff 7-12-96, EXPIRED: 7-12-04 New. #8142, INTERIM, eff 8-21-04, EXPIRED: 2-17-05 New. #8324, eff 4-16-05, EXPIRED: 4-16-13 New. #10320, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRES: 10-22-13; ss by #10426, eff 10-1-13",
